#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: delivery-table-for-flexible-shipping.php
#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:45
msgid "Delivery Table for Flexible Shipping"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: delivery-table-for-flexible-shipping.php
msgid "https://github.com/msiemieniukmorawski/delivery-table-for-flexible-shipping"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: delivery-table-for-flexible-shipping.php
msgid "Auto-generated delivery price table for WooCommerce, built from your Flexible Shipping zones and cost rules. No more hand-maintained shipping tables."
msgstr "Automatisch erzeugte Versandkostentabelle für WooCommerce, gebildet aus deinen Flexible-Shipping-Zonen und Kostenregeln. Schluss mit handgepflegten Versandtabellen."

#. Author of the plugin
#: delivery-table-for-flexible-shipping.php
msgid "Marcin Siemieniuk-Morawski"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: delivery-table-for-flexible-shipping.php
msgid "https://ms-m.pl/"
msgstr ""

#. translators: 1: required PHP version, 2: current PHP version.
#: delivery-table-for-flexible-shipping.php:55
msgid "Delivery Table for Flexible Shipping requires PHP %1$s or newer. This server runs PHP %2$s."
msgstr "Delivery Table for Flexible Shipping benötigt PHP %1$s oder neuer. Auf diesem Server läuft PHP %2$s."

#: includes/Admin/DocumentationPage.php:46
#: includes/Admin/DocumentationPage.php:47
msgid "Delivery Table"
msgstr "Versandtabelle"

#: includes/Admin/DocumentationPage.php:92
msgid "How to use it"
msgstr "Anleitung"

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:26
msgid "Attribute"
msgstr "Attribut"

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:27
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "Wirkung"

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:28
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Beispiel"

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:49
msgid "This plugin reads your Flexible Shipping zones and cost rules and turns them into a delivery price table. There is nothing to configure here — change a rule in Flexible Shipping and the table follows."
msgstr "Das Plugin liest deine Flexible-Shipping-Zonen und Kostenregeln und macht daraus eine Versandkostentabelle. Hier gibt es nichts einzustellen — ändere eine Regel in Flexible Shipping und die Tabelle zieht nach."

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:56
msgid "How to place the table"
msgstr "Tabelle einbinden"

#. translators: 1: shortcode, 2: block name.
#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:62
msgid "Use the shortcode %1$s, or add the \"Delivery Table\" block (%2$s) in the editor. Both render the same table through the same code."
msgstr "Verwende den Shortcode %1$s oder füge im Editor den Block „Delivery Table“ (%2$s) ein. Beide erzeugen dieselbe Tabelle über denselben Code."

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:71
msgid "Columns are order value ranges, built from every price change and every free shipping threshold across the methods in the table. Rows are your shipping methods."
msgstr "Die Spalten sind Bestellwertbereiche, gebildet aus jeder Preisänderung und jeder Grenze für kostenlosen Versand aller Versandarten in der Tabelle. Die Zeilen sind deine Versandarten."

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:81
msgid "Shipping zone name or id. Leave empty to render a table for every zone."
msgstr "Name oder ID der Versandzone. Leer lassen, um für jede Zone eine Tabelle auszugeben."

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:85
msgid "Zone headings: auto (only when several zones are shown), show, or hide."
msgstr "Zonenüberschriften: auto (nur bei mehreren Zonen), show oder hide."

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:89
msgid "Split the output into a prepaid table and a cash-on-delivery table by matching this text in the method title. Empty means one table."
msgstr "Teilt die Ausgabe in eine Vorkasse- und eine Nachnahme-Tabelle, indem dieser Text im Namen der Versandart gesucht wird. Leer bedeutet eine Tabelle."

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:93
msgid "Include shipping methods that are switched off. Default: no."
msgstr "Deaktivierte Versandarten einbeziehen. Standard: nein."

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:97
msgid "Also render the implicit \"Locations not covered by your other zones\" zone."
msgstr "Auch die implizite Zone „Regionen, die nicht von deinen anderen Zonen abgedeckt werden“ ausgeben."

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:103
msgid "How to read the table"
msgstr "Die Tabelle lesen"

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:108
#: src/shipping-table/edit.js:54
msgid "Zone headings"
msgstr "Zonenüberschriften"

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:111
msgid "Headings show the zone regions translated into the storefront language — \"Germany\" in an English shop, \"Deutschland\" in a German one — rather than the zone name you typed in wp-admin. Postcodes limit a zone rather than name it, so they are left out."
msgstr "Überschriften zeigen die Regionen der Zone in der Sprache des Shops — „Germany“ in einem englischen Shop, „Deutschland“ in einem deutschen — statt des im Backend eingetippten Zonennamens. Postleitzahlen grenzen eine Zone ein, benennen sie aber nicht, und bleiben daher weg."

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:119
msgid "A dash instead of a price"
msgstr "Ein Strich statt eines Preises"

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:122
msgid "No cost rule in that method covers that order value — for example when the method is priced by weight rather than by order value. The table says so instead of guessing."
msgstr "Keine Kostenregel dieser Versandart deckt diesen Bestellwert ab — etwa wenn die Versandart nach Gewicht statt nach Bestellwert berechnet wird. Die Tabelle sagt das offen, statt zu raten."

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:130
msgid "Tax"
msgstr "Steuer"

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:133
msgid "Prices are shown gross, including shipping VAT."
msgstr "Preise werden brutto inklusive Versand-MwSt. angezeigt."

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:143
msgid "For developers"
msgstr "Für Entwickler"

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:145
msgid "Template function"
msgstr "Template-Funktion"

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:158
msgid "Overriding the markup"
msgstr "Markup überschreiben"

#. translators: 1: plugin folder name, 2: theme folder name.
#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:164
msgid "Copy a file from the plugin's %1$s folder into %2$s in your theme and edit it there. Child theme wins over parent theme, exactly like WooCommerce templates."
msgstr "Kopiere eine Datei aus dem Ordner %1$s des Plugins nach %2$s in deinem Theme und bearbeite sie dort. Das Child-Theme gewinnt gegen das Parent-Theme, genau wie bei WooCommerce-Templates."

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:171
msgid "Hooks"
msgstr "Hooks"

#: includes/Admin/views/documentation.php:177
msgid "Action. Fires once every service is registered; receives the service container."
msgstr "Action. Wird ausgelöst, sobald alle Services registriert sind; erhält den Service-Container."

#. translators: %s: comma separated list of missing plugin names.
#: includes/Support/Requirements.php:75
msgid "Delivery Table for Flexible Shipping needs %s to be installed and active."
msgid_plural "Delivery Table for Flexible Shipping needs these plugins to be installed and active: %s."
msgstr[0] "Delivery Table for Flexible Shipping benötigt %s — bitte installieren und aktivieren."
msgstr[1] "Delivery Table for Flexible Shipping benötigt diese Plugins — bitte installieren und aktivieren: %s."

#: includes/Table/DeliveryTableRenderer.php:43
msgid "No shipping zone found."
msgstr "Keine Versandzone gefunden."

#: includes/Table/DeliveryTableRenderer.php:59
msgid "No shipping methods to display."
msgstr "Keine Versandarten zum Anzeigen."

#: includes/Table/DeliveryTableRenderer.php:128
msgid "Delivery"
msgstr "Versand"

#: includes/Table/DeliveryTableRenderer.php:129
msgid "Prepaid"
msgstr "Vorkasse"

#: includes/Table/DeliveryTableRenderer.php:130
msgid "Cash on delivery"
msgstr "Nachnahme"

#: includes/Table/IntervalBuilder.php:39
msgid "Order value"
msgstr "Bestellwert"

#. translators: %s: formatted order value, e.g. "148.99 zł".
#: includes/Table/IntervalBuilder.php:57
msgid "Up to %s"
msgstr "Bis %s"

#. translators: 1: lower order value, 2: upper order value.
#: includes/Table/IntervalBuilder.php:62
msgid "%1$s – %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s – %2$s"

#. translators: %s: formatted order value, e.g. "149.00 zł".
#: includes/Table/IntervalBuilder.php:76
msgid "%s and up"
msgstr "Ab %s"

#: includes/Table/TableFactory.php:89
msgid "Free shipping"
msgstr "Kostenloser Versand"

#: includes/Table/TableFactory.php:97
msgid "Reaching this order value is not enough on its own: this method also needs a free shipping coupon."
msgstr "Dieser Bestellwert allein genügt nicht: Diese Versandart braucht zusätzlich einen Gutschein für kostenlosen Versand."

#: includes/Table/TableFactory.php:109
msgid "Not available for this order value"
msgstr "Für diesen Bestellwert nicht verfügbar"

#: includes/Table/TableFactory.php:121
msgid "This price also depends on a condition the table cannot show, such as weight or item count."
msgstr "Dieser Preis hängt zusätzlich von einer Bedingung ab, die die Tabelle nicht zeigt — etwa Gewicht oder Artikelanzahl."

#: templates/table/table.php:21
msgid "Delivery method"
msgstr "Versandart"

#: templates/table/table.php:50
msgid "* This price also depends on something this table cannot show, such as weight, item count or a coupon. The final cost is calculated at checkout."
msgstr "* Dieser Preis hängt zusätzlich von etwas ab, das diese Tabelle nicht zeigt — Gewicht, Artikelanzahl oder einem Gutschein. Der endgültige Betrag wird an der Kasse berechnet."

#: src/shipping-table/edit.js:22
msgid "All zones"
msgstr "Alle Zonen"

#: src/shipping-table/edit.js:37
msgid "Table"
msgstr "Tabelle"

#: src/shipping-table/edit.js:40
msgid "Shipping zone"
msgstr "Versandzone"

#: src/shipping-table/edit.js:46
msgid "Leave on \"All zones\" to render one table per zone."
msgstr "Auf „Alle Zonen“ lassen, um pro Zone eine Tabelle auszugeben."

#: src/shipping-table/edit.js:59
msgid "Only with several zones"
msgstr "Nur bei mehreren Zonen"

#: src/shipping-table/edit.js:64
msgid "Always"
msgstr "Immer"

#: src/shipping-table/edit.js:65
msgid "Never"
msgstr "Nie"

#: src/shipping-table/edit.js:74
msgid "Cash on delivery match"
msgstr "Nachnahme-Erkennung"

#: src/shipping-table/edit.js:79
msgid "Methods whose title contains this text get their own table. Leave empty for a single table."
msgstr "Versandarten, deren Name diesen Text enthält, bekommen eine eigene Tabelle. Leer lassen für eine einzige Tabelle."

#: src/shipping-table/edit.js:87
msgid "Include disabled methods"
msgstr "Deaktivierte Versandarten einbeziehen"

#: src/shipping-table/edit.js:96
msgid "Include \"Locations not covered by your other zones\""
msgstr "„Regionen, die nicht von deinen anderen Zonen abgedeckt werden“ einbeziehen"

#: src/shipping-table/edit.js:115
msgid "Nothing to show yet. Check that the selected zone has Flexible Shipping methods with cost rules."
msgstr "Noch nichts anzuzeigen. Prüfe, ob die gewählte Zone Flexible-Shipping-Versandarten mit Kostenregeln hat."

